  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e3b738bf95984e6ee26e482",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对退缩的伏特加，\n训练员告诉她，即使跑输\n也要“帅气地”全力燃烧殆尽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "716355b7917a237a6a74fa069d8961966e1dbaf511fc9bce66eabdad1d33e463",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6082e01ad4c9f82970d00c48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听到这句话，伏特加缓解了紧张情绪，\n毫不畏惧地挑战比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b899fe40f7f1df9e8bc152813ad90171d8a1e277387a74671bfbcadd874e67c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd885492c26022b2a5e1431a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向阪神JF",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e563476f8b3be29d914b4d6302a47d654bf7f8605b65a44297eb6d03addd483",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba84debdc6e1c575e4c5dc41",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“郁金香赏”当天。\n“阪神JF”时紧张得只会发抖的伏特加，\n现在已经可以冷静地站稳在战场上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9b7be1808fb1669c6a6fabb7779a74699ab6eeda6e97c10c347c784814aa0eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1365af71d6c461622b563f48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加向训练员道谢，多亏了训练员才能\n舒缓紧张。接着又不好意思地坦承\n其中也有受到大和赤骥的影响。",
      "source_fingerprint": "def435b7536af616700f6faa0323ecf1107697c7a521546b27d31ae17778d311",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eca4a0bb99f319fd42204e6d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于站上起跑位置的伏特加，\n为了从真正的起跑点出发……\n迈步前往赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a29a953f8375125ffa10f155df03f418793a4846e03a34e0a12ab4e22a218d79",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:799b8fcf52b4af87d538f827",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向郁金香赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f7a6fcc98e788585d8ba8be1499fb8bfe9bce5605f8f1b2a8f21111698224bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5237ae56f55d173577d5fc72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花花瓣漫天飞舞的舞台“樱花赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3abae2736cb46413882e7f4c8fe80ca006b8a15709834c002b29061460eb7a24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6df95dd699e67b4dd9ea6e7c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以前伏特加总抱着壮烈牺牲的觉悟挑战比赛，\n但现在的她已经不一样了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f26818e5585774c2387c2abde17a26ba16055553a59296ffb7bb15ab14b62139",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ffb0bc2fa9855131a431c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "带着“无论什么比赛我都要赢”的觉悟，\n伏特加迈向与宿敌……\n与大和赤骥在经典赛战线上的初次对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a297477d137f24d167ce5afbc75f4ad6b3909e7b71b90f802fa38a9bc47cc562",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fb39e71cd69120d3ce41db1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向樱花赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f367ec7ef47c518f05db8ab9dada61574097d49d7ace11d949160df55e64191",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e049825b21242dfb6c3a48ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加放弃与劲敌一决胜负，\n选择从小到大的梦想“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01323da4e0cb808a842de8f2b121eb88aa66c8e02c15bedc59c110de79e8b8f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0e6d9b3d2798497ad886167",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她登场时，观众的呼声中交杂着期待与\n轻蔑的话语，甚至参赛的其他赛马娘们\n也对她投以冷漠的眼神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51ec0eac7b4d55ac5bacbab6f6c3498eda52a94281bc5a54ce08f556b8cbcd02",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9d1cdbbd308e2c77a8eb983",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是伏特加毫不在意那些眼光，\n为了展现自己认真以待的生存之道，\n她前往挑战向往的赛事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29b51f07051b52af4e1e304c117573bceb2fb819aa662584771360ce8a06bc0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03d0f3da52e6fd5af6dd55fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向日本德比",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4074326c9093437fbf37c8e5b00d67df67963c2eed1109506df4b11f06953bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaab10dfb6ac8e402a78f840",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“秋华赏”即将到来前的某一天，\n不愿输给伏特加的大和赤骥\n在模拟赛展现了惊人的成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ebb8c4d0f7c7e5aff39cb0275cf4789f77358544064dce046d5b4469ac58d99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9133df16575d155b9880a984",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着……到了双双成长的两人\n即将对战的舞台“秋华赏”当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a6228cf2c73d196cfc95a37c5101c776b5ae7706c580539642c2aa4a74a3d29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:951665178913609b9a8cd2fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加认为大和赤骥够格当自己的对手，\n并即将与之一战。互相认可、成长的两人……\n现在就要认真一较高下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56424b25ea98d4af8b83ecfa87be3e8469073ed56bd6ce3d315eaadfa388e243",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0b45350688b1d4301f93da6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向秋华赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c3f7abc2837ceb7e21241a97f6d971fe2525ff5ff4f9b8623b33edb7b18b79",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e347dcaff425196684225cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "挑战“有马纪念”前，\n伏特加调整行程\n参加了“伊丽莎白女王杯”比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "787cdfc7acecbaf1475a686c259c890d86cf3bc2d14b28cf17c274beb6acae10",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:234f0b89ffbc1f8c1e9c4e6e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥提议赢家将成为女王，\n可以任意命令输家。\n在此条件之下，比赛开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd28f7119dc4a3c115c9a22e1d7563dcdf65fe125d23887fb97a567fcd1ffb20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b40181f541c9dc3d647869c3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向伊丽莎白女王杯",
      "source_fingerprint": "44a73ddfd6c02b8c1013fc96401c76621b531fadd817b597905ef99d5c5ea9a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6e87975809c193d50b679c3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“有马纪念”当天，伏特加的劲敌大和赤骥\n宣告，今天的比赛无论是支持度或比赛成绩，\n自己都会夺得第一名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2584c79ae87cd32809b89b8626e52476c65b09a80306e41bcc3852c3fec95fb4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9f92cbc06bcae727a1f4030",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而伏特加则开始怀疑，像这样继续\n与大和赤骥竞争，一边单纯地追求强悍，\n真的很“帅气”吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0befef4da3ae35fbf95e1d930f65b1d4a3d032a77beae139c1cb81f33de87a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfe0fc250c3e05bacf41a3f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，只会忸忸怩怩地停留在原地的话，\n不用想也知道很逊。她转换心情，\n前往挑战这一年的集大成赛事“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d877607ddb11fd8646f07face4d97c36ae56a9a8563e3ed05ce3205b73e75c6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee72105c0a11058fb963ff4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8edb287453dbd2d303c1750",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“维多利亚英里赛”赛事当天。\n伏特加无论怎么思考都想不出自己欠缺什么，\n于是她决定暂停思考。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cf4d2ba9cc9827ffeef2c8735abfda97fb5ffbf3cf8103b9ddfc0ea24a01a1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76c82233ace37bce99ce54ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天这场比赛的胜负就在一瞬间。\n什么都不要想，只管用尽全力奔跑，\n搞不好就能浮现某种灵感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3279b6870a1e9bfe45fad997ba6ee1a3f58d73c6c047e59ff251fed4adbf8a69",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
