      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:089564bd92257e64f1489bff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "决定春季英里王奖落谁家的\n“安田纪念”就是今天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4028c35fc7ca3de7496e445c4e23182c17db4a66eb7c74680d6644e4f8107647",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b39096d13ef801875c011aba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加宣告，她要以潜心锻炼的冲刺力\n彻底甩开那些强敌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4192eabd89b5ed1c8b500f0782332e93e5d3e522465a7f263c9a418e0c69c7cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26ede54b10f9996110cd7b3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了用最高速度冲过\n“安田纪念”的直线长赛道，\n伏特加踏入赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6953163c6b5e3727a7ebae7b84d32ad6f8896586b3b7a029fbf51ba1b97b3d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
