    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a0eb96883cd47ade53b88d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（秋）”比赛当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "237c506556dfd3aafecdb48994c2347d7f286da718b63317623c4f5f71cb7ae5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fe89691c3705bc6f5b68f32",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因为双方都很强势，\n不会被对方的想法影响，所以伏特加\n与大和赤骥才能贯彻各自的作风直到现在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aabfbcb122295065a1a9d6ae20ac006c5444cda94229afb286eeac792c624175",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81e4c1d91934609c8a98b6c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "互不相让的两人即将在秋天的重要赛事上……\n用尽全力，互相较量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98e075f7548540fbf73d64395d246600cae9ad736efbd3d4cca8caaa8cc64869",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:600299edcde42876d9a67a48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向天皇赏（秋）",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd583fd839f6680a57f75e09880ff12f48e50ac7beeab6d01036df8eff7ff5e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008418.json",
      "json_path": [
