    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd19690ac00900ff4dfbd22e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "顺利地跑完“出道战”，\n伏特加对自己的实力有了确切自信，\n打算乘势直闯GⅠ赛事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "355c843e1b641286b125235ca36fd94f0345a42c8074a0b50ccc511ebab3469c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b340871d8455c1bf0f13679e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后……她受帅气的比赛名称所吸引，\n决定接下来的目标是挑战“阪神JF”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e18e3b33876df4fd209641f0b2bcf14118a93be8e4aacaf7e59d6acd256c4e2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3194ee0a8da09e84d80c0673",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・下次要赢更大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbc8d611c20ea523fb96a94d437773b3eba214280a25ee926c6a5fea5626c6d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e68344493a6bce9420ecf778",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“阪神JF”……\n伏特加硬是超越了GⅠ这个极高的门槛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3923b0a1caccc241fa7afa6999fe5ad5ec196c27d095f3aff3f3ee4279a2eb34",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22dd713572e29b23206963f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛结束后，训练员与伏特加讨论\n接下来的计划。要是目标进军“日本德比”，\n一般都会走上经典三冠路线……",
      "source_fingerprint": "def65741345a5e50f095c9e4ecc271fa1625cb997b486442f865792de0e55096",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:268dca267667d328c54d78ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但受到大和赤骥挑衅的伏特加，\n决定以牙还牙……她打破成规，\n将目标定在挑战“郁金香赏”上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c08b2a527cf0f967df65e55ecf7598cf7f037448f3dfa84e3311a0b12217712b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f426fdf74fcae6c84ad897c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "阪神JF结束后・尽力的伸展！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c04818d440e032c3d284ca562cd4034c9e096f609fcd67fdde7c5daf0507658",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b374ac16c0927c5467547fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加打败了大和赤骥。\n两人都互相感受到对方的成长，\n并约好下次再战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d03daaa3edfe56ec3346f7c17234738828392f58d4dadf492824a95896fa4c83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dc42dfd328e6d0f1d450945",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，若要跟挑战后冠路线的大和赤骥对决，\n就得放弃经典三冠路线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66c974a7a276ebbf83b4d7a9ad2bfa39710187f254304ce51c4dca8d419021c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1008/storytimeline_501008421.json",
      "json_path": [
