      "uid": "zhcn:fe4ab22d0c7eb274efd8b1f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是要与劲敌对决，还是追梦……？\n两者都不想放弃的伏特加，\n决定先挑战完“樱花赏”再做出选择。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0c66609ce5eb9f6cf88c97c5ebb99f179c78678d6b2c990404d2d1a9aae31f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
