      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加在“郁金香赏”输给了大和赤骥。\n两人彼此感受到对方的成长，\n并约好下次再战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2c7f86048def8ccc8fe32d71ea38d604f9fec5f8f5004dba74fcdd4f158eed0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
