      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛后的记者会上，\n被问到下次预定的伏特加，\n乘势宣布即将挑战国外远征。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f757b379e7be234fd5b0da93ead40babcf68437b856d49fcca05520dcc52c4a4",
