      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伏特加在“秋华赏”这场难分轩轾的\n激烈比赛中获胜。她展现出深厚的实力，\n甩开了大和赤骥！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c12acbec5524a3f0244aa6cbca7d2454849774023e6ef68e86449d8ea1167c39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
